        "files": [
          {
            "path": "index.html",
            "language": "html",
            "updatedAt": "2026-09-30T11:33:18.434Z",
            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ja\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>AURA Interactive Prototype</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 min-h-screen p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-sans\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-xl w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl space-y-6\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3\">\n      <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500 to-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/30\">\n        ⚡\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Generated by AURA DEV</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Bring Your Own Key &amp; Model Workspace</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n      このアプリケーションはAURA DEVのコード生成・プレビュー機能で稼働しています。AIエディタから自由にプロンプトを送信し、ファイルを更新できます。\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 block mb-1\">Status</span>\n        <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">● Live Preview Active</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 block mb-1\">Architecture</span>\n        <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-300\">Single File HTML/JS</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button onclick=\"changeColor()\" class=\"w-full py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-medium rounded-xl transition shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 cursor-pointer\">\n      クリックしてインタラクションテスト\n    </button>\n    <div id=\"counterBox\" class=\"text-center text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono\">\n      Clicks: <span id=\"clickCount\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-bold\">0</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    let clicks = 0;\n    function changeColor() {\n      clicks++;\n      document.getElementById('clickCount').innerText = clicks;\n      const colors = ['#6366f1', '#06b6d4', '#10b981', '#f59e0b', '#ec4899'];\n      const chosen = colors[clicks % colors.length];\n      document.getElementById('clickCount').style.color = chosen;\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>"
          },
